  "boundaries": [
    "PageMembership::new consumes the existing PageCursor complete map/bitmap preflight. One map and one bitmap are retained in fallible prepaid heap storage; lookup uses the existing bitmap set-bit grammar.",
    "Newly loaded cached bitmaps are signature/address-validated before lookup. Empty selections still preflight complete usage metadata.",
    "Only table data-page membership for profile.complete()==false changes. All/complete reads, full checks, index-owned page materialization and mutation gates retain the 4,096-address limit.",
    "Selected roots still require membership, live slots/owner, bounded relocation, schema validation and exact key agreement; no fallback, codec or write support added.",
    "Stable/offline source ownership remains required; cache reread checks do not promise live-file snapshot isolation.",
    "No Access/query/CLI tests or original after-change CLI run are counted here."
  ],
